  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bb30db87e74f1041b218c5-44f1947d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into sticks. Trim and halve green beans.\n• Cut firm tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm cubes.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tofu and Chinese BBQ seasoning.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, the soy sauce, vinegar, water (for the sauce) and sesame seeds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bb30db87e74f1041b218c5-77e7302d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Stir-fry carrot and green beans until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Add remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Season, transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.\n• Return pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, turning, until browned, 3-4 mins (cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded).\n• Remove pan from heat and add sweet chilli sauce mixture, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bb30db87e74f1041b218c5-eb2bb158.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with tofu and veggies.\n• Spoon over any remaining glaze from pan. Drizzle with the mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bb30db87e74f1041b218c5-818f8c85.jpeg"
    }
  ]
